IMPORT `aa-practice`

-- Architects Act 1991, ss 3, 10-15, 17B, 17C, 18, 19, 26A(2), 31G, 34 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_architects-act-1991.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

